摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A TypeScript-based Garmin Connect plugin and MCP server with secure browser-based MFA, built for DeepSeek Harness and designed to work with other AI agents.","id":"gh:1338566237","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"garmin-connect-plugin-for-dsh","slug":"Likenttt/garmin-connect-plugin-for-dsh","topics":["claude","claude-code","claude-code-plugin","claude-skills","codex","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin","workbuddy","zcode-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A TypeScript-based Garmin Connect plugin and MCP server with secure browser-based MFA, built for Dee"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"pSeek Harness and designed to work with other AI agents."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-garmin-connect"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A TypeScript-based Garmin Connect plugin and MCP server with **official Personal API and secure br"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"owser-based MFA**, built for DeepSeek Harness and designed to work with other AI agents."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | **简体中文** | **Test Report** | **Changelog**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Developed by Li Erniu (李二牛), connecting Garmin training to your AI assistant.**"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This open-source DeepSeek Harness plugin and MCP connector support Garmin China and International ac"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"counts. Explore full activities and splits, sleep, heart rate and HRV with AI, then create, schedule"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" or delete workouts or cancel calendar entries after your confirmation."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**You control your account. Your password is not shared with AI.** With the recommended Garmin brows"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"er sign-in, passwords and verification codes are entered only on Garmin’s official page, not given t"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"o AI or the developer. Session credentials are stored locally with restricted file permissions. Auth"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"orized fitness and health queries return data to your chosen AI client for analysis."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Works with mainstream coding agents and AI workspaces"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness ·\nWorkBuddy ·\nQwen Work ·\nZCode ·\nClaude Code ·\nCodex ·\nCursor ·\nWindsurf"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Connect through MCP or a SKILL.md workflow, depending on the client."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> **MFA support in 0.1.6:** local dsh Web, the\n> `garmin-connect-auth serve` system-browse"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"r flow, and MCP URL elicitation can\n> bootstrap the same owner-only session for China and Internatio"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"nal accounts.\n> Real-account MFA completed in both regions on 2026-08-29, including a full\n> China-r"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"egion browser-to-session-and-read chain and an International-region\n> system-browser DI exchange wit"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"h owner-only session persistence. Browser policy\n> may still block an individual flow.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## More Apps"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Icon | App | What it does |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| [](https://wristtale.com) | WristTale | Read TXT and Markdown on your Garmin, Apple, and Android w"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"atch |\n| [](https://jiake.app) | JiaKe.app | Turn Garmin screenshots into polished assets |\n| [](htt"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ps://gamerasnap.com) | GameraSnap | Control your phone camera from your Garmin watch |\n| [](https://"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"wristalbum.wristtale.com) | WristAlbum | Keep a private photo album on your Garmin |\n| [](https://wr"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"istpass.li2niu.com) | WristPass | Keep cards and tickets ready on your wrist |\n| [](https://2fa4g.li"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"2niu.com) | 2FA4G | Keep offline 2FA codes on your Garmin |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## What It Does"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"This plugin connects DeepSeek Harness or any MCP-compatible AI agent to Garmin Connect, exposing you"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"r wearable data as **AI-callable tools**. Once installed, the agent can automatically query your act"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ivities, sleep, steps, and heart rate to provide personalized fitness insights — all through natural"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"leep, steps, and heart rate to provide personalized fitness insights — all through natural language."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Registered Tools"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Version **0.1.21 registers 30 tools in Harness** (including `list_garmin_accounts`) and **31 tools i"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"n shared-workspace MCP** (also including `open_garmin_workspace`). The selected account's provider d"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"etermines which operations are available.\nLegacy single-account Connect MCP retains **29 tools**. Of"},{"id":"p18s4","text":" those base tools, twenty-four provide queries or local advice without writing;\n`download_garmin_act"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"ivity_fit` writes one local file on the MCP/dsh host. Creating, scheduling or deleting\na workout and"},{"id":"p18s6","text":" cancelling a calendar entry change Garmin data after explicit confirmation.\nLegacy Personal MCP ser"},{"id":"p18s7","text":"vers expose **15 compatible tools** for Garmin reads,\nlocal FIT downloads and local coaching knowled"},{"id":"p18s8","text":"ge. Harness and shared-workspace MCP\nkeep stable tool catalogs and route each call by the selected a"},{"id":"p18s9","text":"ccount’s capabilities.\nThe 13 recovery and training tools introduced in 0.1.14 depend on\nthe publish"},{"id":"p18s10","text":"ed maintained SDK through an exact npm alias; see\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> **Credentials are used locally to authenticate directly with Garmin Connect\n> and are never return"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" used locally to authenticate directly with Garmin Connect\n> and are never returned by an AI tool.**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Target architecture for two-step verification"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The architecture gives dsh Web, MCP clients, and the CLI one shared local\nauthentication runtime whi"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"le keeping Garmin credentials out of AI conversations:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The non-negotiable boundaries are:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- During authentication, the outer dsh page receives a one-time local URL and\ncoarse progress; its s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"eparate local settings form handles the account email.\nMCP clients and the model receive only a URL,"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" completion notification, or\ncoarse non-sensitive status. Tickets, DI tokens, session contents, and "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"session\npaths never enter model context or AI tool arguments/results.\n- The bridge accepts only the "},{"id":"p27s5","text":"expected Garmin SSO origin, iframe window, CSRF,\nand an exactly matched `ticket/service` pair. It ne"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"ver rewrites the service,\nfollows a redirect, or retries a one-time ticket against a fallback.\n- Bef"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"ore saving a session, the Host probes the Garmin profile and asks the user\nto confirm the account. I"},{"id":"p27s8","text":"t then writes the session atomically with private\npermissions. A running client hot-loads only a cha"},{"id":"p27s9","text":"nged, account-matching,\nvalidated session.\n- Authentication never replays the original tool automati"},{"id":"p27s10","text":"cally, preventing\nduplicate FIT downloads or workout writes. Failure, cancellation, or timeout\nends "},{"id":"p27s11","text":"the flow; another attempt creates a new flow.\n- Refresh may replay a safe GET at most once. It first"},{"id":"p27s12","text":" verifies the same profile\nand persists rotated tokens; writes are never replayed after refresh."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> This is the target architecture and the boundary followed by the current\n> release-suppo"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"rted implementation. A real China-region MFA → exact ticket/service\n> → DI exchange → profile confir"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"mation → private session write → fresh-client\n> read chain has passed locally. A real International-"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"region MFA → DI exchange\n> → profile confirmation → private session write also passed. Real refresh-"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"token\n> rotation and complete URL-elicitation UX in more MCP clients remain ongoing\n> compatibility "},{"id":"p28s6","text":"coverage.\n> The design is same-machine loopback only, not a remote, multi-user, or hosted\n> authenti"},{"id":"p28s7","text":" design is same-machine loopback only, not a remote, multi-user, or hosted\n> authentication service."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
